      "control_id": "CTL.BACKUP.VAULT.LOCK.001",
      "control_name": "Backup Vaults Must Have Vault Lock Enabled",
      "control_description": "AWS Backup vaults must have vault lock enabled to prevent deletion of recovery points. Without vault lock, an attacker with vault access can delete all backups before conducting a destructive attack — the ransomware pattern eliminates the recovery path before encrypting production data.\n",
